@startuml
title Mediator Pattern - Class Diagram

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontStyle bold

interface Mediator {
    +notify(sender: Component, event: String): void
}

class Component {
    #mediator: Mediator
    +Component(mediator: Mediator)
    +setMediator(mediator: Mediator): void
}

class Button extends Component {
    -label: String
    +Button(mediator: Mediator, label: String)
    +click(): void
}

class Textbox extends Component {
    -text: String
    +Textbox(mediator: Mediator)
    +getText(): String
    +setText(t: String): void
    +keypress(): void
}

class Checkbox extends Component {
    -checked: boolean
    +Checkbox(mediator: Mediator)
    +isChecked(): boolean
    +check(): void
}

class AuthenticationDialog implements Mediator {
    -loginButton: Button
    -registerButton: Button
    -usernameField: Textbox
    -passwordField: Textbox
    -rememberMeCheckbox: Checkbox
    -hiddenField: Textbox
    +AuthenticationDialog()
    +notify(sender: Component, event: String): void
}

Component --> Mediator : mediator
AuthenticationDialog --> Button
AuthenticationDialog --> Textbox
AuthenticationDialog --> Checkbox

note bottom of AuthenticationDialog
  Concrete mediator coordinates
  all component interactions
end note

@enduml
